# =============================================================================
#  STARFIRE - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Starbolt")             Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "Starfire_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "Starfire_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, pelvis + legs included)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s - weightless, graceful, warm
#    hover   : floats ~0.8 stud off the ground (never above ~1.2), slow bob, tiny drift;
#              legs dangle and trail with overlap (knees tuck, toes pointed)
#    0-48    : relaxed, welcoming arms; curious glances
#    48-164  : hands rise and cup in front of her - the starbolt charge breathes and circles
#    164-282 : arms sweep open into a joyful embrace, chest opens, she lifts a little higher
#              and turns gently; a ripple runs out through the wrists
#    282-360 : arms float back down, body settles back to the hover
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.  Root height is animated on TORSO only.
# =============================================================================
